''This page is part of the [[MR_Ignite/2026/Grand_Finals|Ignite 2026: Grand Finals]] article.''

==Format==
* '''Group Stage''': November ''23<sup>rd</sup>'' - ''25<sup>th</sup>'', 2026''
** Teams are divided into 2 Groups based on seeding
** Each group plays a Single '''Round-Robin''' format
*** Each Group has 6 teams
*** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** {{Bgcolortext|up|Top 4 teams}} from each group advance to ''[[MR Ignite/2026/Grand Finals#Playoffs|Playoffs]]''

